      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} Thank you all for working with RTSP feature requests. 2020.4.4 has been public released, but it has same issue.\nReproduction steps are simple:\n1. Place UdonSyncPlayer (AVPro) to scene\n2. Remove Udon Behaviour component on placed GameObject \"UdonSyncPlayer (AVPro)\" in order to avoid frequent syncing for live source\n3. Enter Video URL at VRCAVProVideoPlayer component to rtspt://topaz.chat/live/latencyTest (edit for your stream key)\n4. Check Use Low Latency at VRCAVProVideoPlayer component\n5. Build & Test (check Allow Untrusted URLs on VRChat setting before launch)\nThanks!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
